title: "Stunting Determinant Organization Across Developmental Stages"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for measuring how the attribution structure of stunting
  determinants differs between two developmental stages, using three Indonesian
  national surveys. Five phases: measurement, domain dictionary, attribution
  shares, interpretation, and robustness.
